title: Inter-Party Relationships
new-page: true
view-if: b_inter_party_relationships_timer <= 0 and player_party = "b"
is-card: true
on-arrival: inter_party_relationships_timer += 4; week_actions += 1
card-image: img/portraits/taburin_b_m.jpg
tags: b_party

= Inter-Party Relationships

We can improve our relations with the other democratic or socialist parties.

- @anarchists
- @lsr
- @sr
- @mensheviks
- @kadets 
- @internationalists
- @moderates
- @root: We do not need to improve our relations.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action


@anarchists
title: Anarchists & Maximalists — Improve our relations. 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and anarchists_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if anarchists_legal != 1: We have banned these groups. ?]
on-arrival: anarchist_relation += 8*(1-b_dissent); maximalist_relation += 8*(1-b_dissent); b_resources -= 1;

We have improved our relations with the anarchists and maximalists. 


@lsr
title: Left-SRs — Improve our relations. 
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and lsr_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if lsr_legal != 1: We have banned this party. ?]
on-arrival: lsr_relation += 8*(1-b_dissent); b_resources -= 1;

We have improved our relations with the Left-SRs. 


@sr
title: SRs — Can we repair relations with them as a whole?
subtitle: -1 party funds
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and sr_legal = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [?if b_resources < 1: -1 party funds — We lack the resources for this. ?][?if sr_legal != 1: We have banned these parties. ?]
on-arrival:{!
Q.b_resources -= 1;
Q.moderate_dissent -= 3;
Q.moderate_strength += 3;
Q.leninist_dissent += 3;
Q.leftcom_dissent += 2;
Q.lsr_relation += 3 * (1 - Q.b_dissent);
Q.centre_sr_relation += 3 + Math.max(
    0,
    (6 * (1 - Q.b_dissent))
    - Math.max(0, (Q.leninist_strength / Q.moderate_strength))
    + Math.max(0, (Q.moderate_strength / Q.leninist_strength))
);
Q.right_sr_relation += 3 + Math.max(
    0,
    (4 * (1 - Q.b_dissent))
    - Math.max(0, (Q.leninist_strength / Q.moderate_strength))
    + Math.max(0, (Q.moderate_strength / Q.leninist_strength))
);
Q.right_sr_strength -= 3;
!}

Appealing to the SRs is unexpected, but welcome by those in favor of conciliationism on either side. [? if leninist_strength >= moderate_strength : The influence of Lenin however makes it difficult for us to make further in-roads. ?]


@mensheviks
title: Mensheviks — Can we repair relations with them? 
